{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>英國哈里王子11月14日突訪烏克蘭，探訪傷兵、殘障退役軍人及醫護人員，參與Invictus Games（專為殘障軍人而設的國際賽）的練習，出席會議或講座。影片中可見，哈里在一個講座中說：「你們將會贏得這場戰爭。」亦見哈里與殘障者一同打匹克球；在醫院探望傷兵。（法新社）</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T04:32:21.024176+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T03:33:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T13:11:57.341973+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T04:25:52.360634+00:00","content_hash":"c34c2a878298908085c8b093097058435e033c457e4f471a162f512d549f2030","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}